// accepted at Accuracy 0 off the 320-bit gain by 2.756e-3 (rv49v 4080
// NoScaling false, Q(1 - 171 eps), as generated on arm64) and 3.19e-4
// (Q(1 + 145 eps), as generated on amd64); YN7QHM demoted them to
// ErrAccuracyUnverified. Two Hewer steps moved K beyond newtonTol where the
// third matched the 320-bit gain, so on the platform each row was generated
// on Dare returns that gain with a nil error (GIXTHD; rv48 846 and 3711 are
// the same class, their K of X 1.35e-5 and 9.3e-6 off). Wherever the error
